bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:1:1: BOUY206: enums are not supported; use a union of string literals
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:6:3: BOUY206: static class members are not supported; use a module-level const
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:7:3: BOUY206: getters and setters are not supported; use a method
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:12:8: BOUY206: class inheritance is supported only for error classes: extends Error, TypeError, RangeError, or SyntaxError, or Data.TaggedError("Tag") or Data.Error with `Data` from "effect"
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:15:3: BOUY206: `yield` without `*` is not supported: a generator function is the body of an Effect, and `yield* effect` runs an Effect
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:18:8: BOUY206: async generators are not supported; a generator function is the body of an Effect, so drop `async` and run asynchronous work with `yield*`
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:23:8: BOUY206: a generator method is not supported; return `Effect.gen(function* () { ... })` from a plain method
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:27:3: BOUY206: `var` is not supported; use `let` or `const`
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:28:3: BOUY206: labeled statements are not supported; move the loop into a function and return from it
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:31:14: BOUY206: regular expressions are not supported yet
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:35:3: BOUY206: `.then()` chains are not supported; use `await` and try/catch
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:36:3: BOUY206: `new Promise` is not supported; call the async function and await it
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:42:5: BOUY206: `switch` fall-through between non-empty cases is not supported; end the case with `break` or `return`
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:48:14: BOUY206: `arguments` is not supported; use a rest parameter
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:53:1: BOUY206: `import x = require(...)` is not supported; use an import declaration
bouy206-unsupported-syntax.ts:56:3: BOUY206: decorators are not supported
